# Event-driven

- Use domain events (`@nestjs/event-emitter` or `@nestjs/cqrs`) for cross-module side effects
- Do not emit “must-deliver” events inside a DB transaction without delivery guarantee
- For critical events, use **Outbox pattern** (persist event with business transaction + relay)
- Consider saga patterns for distributed workflows (only when needed)

